  (text "Dock sheet (step 6): six pads at 2 mm pitch, about 1.2 x 3 mm:\n1 VIN  2 GND  3 SWDCLK  4 SWDIO  5 UART_RX  6 UART_TX\n- TVS on every pad, leakage under 50 nA; VIN TVS working voltage at least 5.5 V.\n- 100 ohm in series on the four data pads. Pull-down on UART_RX." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid add8640e-8915-4ad0-91c9-a6f04058226b))
